  "content": [
    {
      "id": "introduction",
      "title": "Introduction",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">The next level after fixed window. Here the <b>window size is not given</b> to you it grows and shrinks on its own depending on a condition you define.</span>",
          "items": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1-fixed-vs-dynamic-nbsp",
      "title": "1. Fixed vs Dynamic&nbsp;",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "table",
          "text": "",
          "items": [],
          "content": "{\"headers\":[\"Fixed window\",\"Dynamic window\"],\"rows\":[[\"Window size\",\"Changes as you go\"],[\"Right pointer\",\"Moves every step\"],[\"Left pointer\",\"Moves every step\"],[\"Typical ask\",\"Moves only when condition breaks\"],[\"Max/min of every window\",\"Longest/shortest window satisfying a condition\"]]}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "text": "<strong>One line summary:&nbsp;</strong>In dynamic window,<code>right</code>always moves forward.<code>left</code>only moves when the window becomes invalid.",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "heading2",
          "text": "<hr style=\"border-width: 1px medium medium; border-style: solid none none; border-color: rgb(224, 224, 224) currentcolor currentcolor; border-image: none; margin: 24px 0px;\">",
          "items": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2-the-problem-first",
      "title": "2. The Problem First",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Given an array of positive numbers, find the&nbsp;<strong>length of the longest subarray whose sum is less than or equal to 9</strong>.",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "items": [],
          "url": "/engineering/dsa-media/1785251096951-16907382.png",
          "caption": "",
          "content": "/engineering/dsa-media/1785251096951-16907382.png",
          "text": "/engineering/dsa-media/1785251096951-16907382.png",
          "alt": "Dynamic window: unknown size, sum <= 9 concept"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You don't know the size of the answer window in advance it could be 2 elements wide or 5. That's exactly when dynamic window applies.",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3-the-core-idea",
      "title": "3. The Core Idea",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You use two pointers <code>left</code>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<code>right</code>&nbsp;both starting at index 0.",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "<strong>Expand</strong>&nbsp;move&nbsp;<code>right</code>&nbsp;forward to grow the window, adding each new element",
            "<strong>Shrink</strong>&nbsp;when the window breaks the condition, move&nbsp;<code>left</code>&nbsp;forward to fix it",
            "<strong>Track</strong>&nbsp;after every valid state, record the window size if it's the best so far"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "text": "<strong>Think of it like this:&nbsp;</strong>right is greedy it always wants more. left is the guard it steps in only when things go wrong.",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4-step-by-step-sum-9",
      "title": "4. Step by Step: Sum ≤ 9",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Array:&nbsp;<code>[2, 1, 5, 3, 2, 4]</code>&nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp; Condition: sum ≤ 9",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Step 1:&nbsp;</strong>right=0, add 2. sum=2 ✓",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "items": [],
          "url": "/engineering/dsa-media/1785251099032-890332705.png",
          "caption": "",
          "content": "/engineering/dsa-media/1785251099032-890332705.png",
          "text": "/engineering/dsa-media/1785251099032-890332705.png",
          "alt": "Step 1: right=0, add 2, sum=2 valid"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "left=0, right=0 | sum=2 |valid → length=1",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Step 2:&nbsp;</strong>right=1, add 1. sum=3 ✓",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785251101064-897136808.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "left=0, right=1 | sum=3 |valid → length=2",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong></strong>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Step 3:</strong>&nbsp;right=2, add 5. sum=8 ✓",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785251102649-954086178.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "left=0, right=2 | sum=8 |valid → length=3",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong></strong>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Step 4:&nbsp;</strong>right=3, add 3. sum=11 ✗ — too big! Shrink from left.",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785251104271-342020663.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "left=0, right=3 | sum=11 |invalid → move left forward",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<b>Remove</b> arr[left]=2, left moves to 1. sum = 11−2 = 9 ✓",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785251105851-256572948.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "left=1, right=3 | sum=9 |valid → length=3",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong></strong>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Step 5:</strong>&nbsp;right=4, add 2. sum=11 ✗ again. Shrink: remove arr[1]=1, left→2. sum=10 ✗ still. Shrink again: remove arr[2]=5, left→3. sum=5 ✓",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "items": [],
          "url": "/engineering/dsa-media/1785251107499-474501662.png",
          "caption": "",
          "content": "/engineering/dsa-media/1785251107499-474501662.png",
          "text": "/engineering/dsa-media/1785251107499-474501662.png",
          "alt": "Step 5: two shrinks from sum=11 down to sum=5 valid"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "eft=3, right=4 | sum=5 |valid → length=2",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong></strong>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Step 6:</strong>&nbsp;right=5, add 4. sum=9 ✓",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<img src=\"/engineering/dsa-media/1785251108980-505958405.png\" alt=\"image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 16px 0px; border-radius: 4px;\">",
          "items": [],
          "content": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "left=3, right=5 | sum=9 |valid → length=3",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Answer:&nbsp;<strong>3</strong>&nbsp;(there were multiple windows of length 3, the longest valid one found).",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "5-the-template",
      "title": "5. The Template",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "<strong style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">Start both pointers at 0.&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">Initialize your tracking variable (sum, count, etc.)</span><br>",
            "<strong style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">Expand right&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">add</span><code style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">arr[right]</code><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">to your window on every iteration</span><br>",
            "<strong style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">Shrink left&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">while the condition is broken, remove</span><code style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">arr[left]</code><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">and move left forward</span><br>",
            "<strong style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">Record the answer</strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.003em;\">&nbsp;once the window is valid again, check if it's the longest/shortest so far</span><br>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<b>longest subarray with sum ≤ target</b>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "items": [],
          "codes": {
            "javascript": "#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <algorithm>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint longestWindow(vector<int>& arr, int target) {\n    int left = 0;\n    int current_sum = 0;\n    int max_length = 0;\n\n    for (int right = 0; right < arr.size(); right++) {\n        current_sum += arr[right];   // expand window\n\n        while (current_sum > target) { // shrink window\n            current_sum -= arr[left];\n            left++;\n        }\n\n        max_length = max(max_length, right - left + 1);\n    }\n\n    return max_length;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    vector<int> arr = {2, 1, 5, 3, 2, 4};\n    cout << longestWindow(arr, 9) << endl;  // 3\n}\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Time complexity:&nbsp;<strong>O(n):</strong>&nbsp;right moves forward n times, left moves forward at most n times total.<br>Space complexity:&nbsp;<strong>O(1):&nbsp;</strong>just two pointers and a variable.",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "6-dynamic-sliding-window-keywords",
      "title": "6. Dynamic Sliding Window Keywords",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "table",
          "items": [],
          "url": "",
          "caption": "",
          "content": "{\"headers\":[\"Category\",\"Keywords / Phrases\"],\"rows\":[[\"Size Condition Indicators\",\"at most k, at least k, no more than k, no less than k\"],[\"Optimization Indicators\",\"longest substring, longest subarray, smallest substring, minimum window\"],[\"Constraint-Based Indicators\",\"without repeating characters, with k distinct characters, with at most k distinct\"],[\"Dynamic Length Indicators\",\"variable length, expand window, shrink window\"],[\"Coverage Problems\",\"contains all characters, covers all elements, minimum window containing\"]]}",
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<strong>Quick rule:</strong>",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If the problem asks for&nbsp;<strong>longest / smallest / minimum window with some condition&nbsp;</strong>and the&nbsp;<strong>window size is not fixed</strong>, it usually indicates a<strong>Variable (Dynamic) Sliding Window&nbsp;</strong>problem.",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "divider",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "heading2",
          "text": "Where You'll See This",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "Longest subarray with sum less than or equal to k",
            "Longest substring without repeating characters",
            "Smallest subarray with sum greater than or equal to k",
            "Longest substring with at most k distinct characters"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "items": []
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "<p><strong>Fixed vs Dynamic quick check:&nbsp;</strong>If the problem gives you a window size k → use fixed window.&nbsp;</p><p>If the problem asks for the longest or shortest subarray satisfying a condition → use dynamic window.</p>",
          "items": []
        },
